# Rust build artifacts
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Tooling caches — but not the checked-in build config. `.cargo/config.toml` carries
# the `[env]` block the test suite depends on (deferred-secret fixtures, the prefixed
# non-config variables that guard unknown-key detection). Without it a fresh clone
# fails the whole suite for reasons that look nothing like the cause.
/.cargo/*
!/.cargo/config.toml

# OS/editor noise
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/

# Logs and temp files
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp

# Custom
FINDINGS.md
REVIEW.md
REFACTOR.md

# Zola build output — the site is built in CI and published to Pages, never committed.
/site/public/

# cargo-fuzz artefacts (corpora and crashes are kept out of the repo).
/fuzz/target/
/fuzz/corpus/
/fuzz/artifacts/
